Package: symcompR
Title: Symbolic Computation in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Adam R", "Sophie", email = "adamrsophie@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A native R computer algebra system ported from the Python
    library 'SymPy'. Provides exact integer and rational arithmetic,
    automatically simplified symbolic expressions, assumptions, symbolic
    differentiation, series, limits, integration, polynomial algebra,
    equation solving, matrices, number theory, combinatorics, logic, sets,
    and code printing, all implemented in R without a Python dependency.
    The design and algorithms follow 'SymPy'
    <https://www.sympy.org>; the 'SymPy' Development Team is gratefully
    acknowledged, and its BSD license notice is retained in the package.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
